@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = replace-with-a-valid-access-token
@id = 1

### Register an HTTP operation as an authorization resource
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/example/:id",
  "description": "Example operation"
}

### Duplicate method/path pair returns 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/shipments/:id"
}

### Replace operation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "PATCH",
  "path": "/api/example/:id",
  "description": "Updated operation"
}

### Partial update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Logical deletion disables grants while retaining them
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Physical deletion also removes role-resource grants
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recursos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
